WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.020
Hey everyone, I’m Ranjani, here to announce a new
series we’re starting called Missing Chapter!

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.630
The goal of this series is to tell stories
that often don’t make it into our history

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.900
textbooks — that are overlooked or underreported.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.320
Our first season tackles stories of racial
injustice, political conflicts, even the hidden

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.960
history of US medical experimentation.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:32.380
I’ll take you to the locations where these
historical events happened, dig up the evidence,

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:36.560
and meet the historians and locals who are
personally connected to these stories.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:41.060
“Many people didn’t speak about it, they
kind of internalized it.”

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:46.440
“Wilmington did a really great job of covering
up a very dark past for a very long time.”

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:51.940
“Political power is truly seized by the
barrel of a gun.”

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:57.220
Through their voices and these stories, we’ll
revisit the past to give context to the present day.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:02.040
A few months ago we put out a call for what stories you think we should tell with this series— and we

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.110
got hundreds of responses!

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:09.560
One of the suggestions we got the most was
the story of an 1898 American election and

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.400
coup d’etat in North Carolina.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.740
And, that’s exactly what we’re covering
first.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:18.140
We’re also trying something out for how
we’re publishing this first Missing Chapter story.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:22.800
We're giving Vox Video Lab members early access, so they can watch this video right now.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:28.460
If you want to get early access, you can
sign up by going to vox.com/join.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:32.380
But don’t worry, &nbsp;this is not a paywall.
In one week, we’re going to publish

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:36.040
this video right here on the main channel
for all of our viewers.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.240
Hope you enjoy the first episode!

